1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,810
So, tokenized stocks trade 24/7, right?

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,390
But the actual stock market closes at 4.

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:10,090
And once it's closed, the issuer can't mint or redeem.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,650
And there's no real price to check against.

5
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:17,030
So on weekends, the liquidity providers are basically just eating that whole

6
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,030
gap, for free.

7
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,010
And this actually happened.

8
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:23,870
Back in August, a memecoin on Robinhood Chain paired itself against

9
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,130
tokenized Hims & Hers.

10
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:29,090
And over one weekend, the wrapper ran up to about 61 bucks.

11
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:31,670
The real stock had closed under 29.

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,030
None of the big pools on the chain had any idea the

13
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:35,850
market was even closed.

14
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:37,970
So I built Gapguard.

15
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:41,310
It's a Uniswap v4 hook that prices the closed market.

16
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:44,390
It works out the New York Stock Exchange calendar on-chain.

17
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,610
Holidays, half days, daylight saving, all of it.

18
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:48,250
No oracle.

19
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:51,410
When the market's open, you just pay the normal fee.

20
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:54,390
When it's closed, you pay for the gap risk you're creating.

21
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:57,650
And the further you push the price from the last close, the

22
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,110
more it costs.

23
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:01,550
If you're trading back toward it, so you're helping restore the peg,

24
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:02,550
it stays cheap.

25
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:06,350
I replayed that Hims weekend on-chain, and the LPs end up

26
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:08,330
earning almost 13 times more.

27
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:11,250
It's live on Robinhood Chain mainnet right now.

28
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:14,130
No owner, no admin keys, and it can't be upgraded.

29
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:18,130
It's been through three security reviews and 39 tests, and the source

30
00:01:17,980 --> 00:01:18,510
is verified.

31
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:22,210
Robinhood Chain is where tokenized stocks are going to live.

32
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:25,390
And Gapguard is how you make it safe to provide liquidity for

33
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,210
them after the bell.

34
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:27,290
I'm David.

35
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:29,870
I'm an Air Force vet, and I build on-chain stuff.

36
00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:31,090
This is Gapguard.

